# PSA INVESTMENT - PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ===================================================================
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env.local' or set these variables in your hosting dashboard (Vercel / QServer / Netlify).
# 2. DO NOT commit '.env.local' or any file containing real API keys to GitHub.
# 3. All VITE_* variables are exposed to the browser client; never place service_role or master database passwords here.

# --- ZERO-COST CLOUD DATABASE: FIREBASE FIRESTORE (Google Cloud Spark Plan) ---
